Conflicts: corry-debion, corry (<< 0.2), corry-profile, calamares, calamares-settings-debian
Replaces: corry-debion, corry (<< 0.2), corry-profile, calamares, calamares-settings-debian
Provides: corry, calamares
Description: Corry installer for Edukasaun OS
 Corry installs Edukasaun OS from a live session, step by step: welcome,
 system check, location, keyboard, partitions (including GParted), users,
 installation with a slideshow and music, and finish. It works with and
 without internet and removes itself from the installed system.
 .
 This package is built for Debian stable and contains the complete installer
 with the Edukasaun OS branding. It replaces Debian's calamares and
 calamares-settings-debian, makes Corry the default installer and puts an
 "Install Edukasaun OS" shortcut on the users' desktops.

