Description: Corry installer for DebION GNU/Linux
 Corry installs DebION GNU/Linux from a live session, step by step: welcome,
 system check, location, keyboard, partitions (including GParted), users,
 installation with a slideshow and music, and finish. It works with and
 without internet and removes itself from the installed system.
 .
 This package is built for Debian testing and contains the complete installer
 with the DebION GNU/Linux branding. It replaces Debian's calamares and
 calamares-settings-debian, makes Corry the default installer and puts an
 "Install DebION GNU/Linux" shortcut on the users' desktops.
